      "skills": [
        "grammar.he_she_it"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "लड़के के लिए ‘He’, लड़की के लिए ‘She’, चीज़ या जानवर के लिए ‘It’. तीनों के साथ ‘is’ आता है।",
        "hinglish": "Ladke ke liye ‘He’, ladki ke liye ‘She’, cheez ya jaanwar ke liye ‘It’. Teeno ke saath ‘is’ aata hai.",
        "en": "Use ‘He’ for a boy, ‘She’ for a girl, and ‘It’ for a thing or animal. All three go with ‘is’."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "L3.U03.S02",
      "skills": [
        "grammar.he_she_it"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "हिंदी में ‘वह’ सबके लिए है, पर इंग्लिश में तीन शब्द हैं: He, She, It. ‘लंबा’ या ‘लंबी’ से पता चलता है कौन!",
        "hinglish": "Hindi mein ‘woh’ sabke liye hai, par English mein teen shabd hain: He, She, It. ‘Lamba’ ya ‘lambi’ se pata chalta hai kaun!",
        "en": "Hindi uses ‘woh’ for everyone, but English has three words: He, She, It."
      }
    },
